      "range": "*"
    },
    "message": "Not needed anymore: SQLitePCLRaw now includes SQLite for WebAssembly. If you use sqlite-net-pcl 1.11 or later, or Microsoft.Data.Sqlite, remove Uno.sqlite-wasm, Uno.SQLitePCLRaw.provider.wasm and any SQLitePCLRaw.bundle_sqlite3, SQLitePCLRaw.provider.sqlite3 or SQLitePCLRaw.bundle_green references added for them; nothing else is needed. Otherwise, use SQLitePCLRaw.bundle_e_sqlite3. These packages don't work on Uno Platform 7, or on Uno Platform 6.7 apps that use the Skia renderer (the default).",
    "reasons": [
      "Legacy"
    ]
